{"step_index":235,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-25T13:55:02Z","content":"**NexLev has an API Key!** This is the solution! The API key works as a Bearer token — much simpler than OAuth. \n\nHere's what I need you to do — **one simple thing:**\n\n### 👉 Click on **\"NexLev API\"** in your dashboard sidebar\n\nYou can see it right there in your screenshot — left sidebar, under \"Tools\":\n- Niche Finder\n- Chrome Extension\n- **NexLev API** ← Click this one!\n\nIt will show you an **API Key**. **Copy it and paste it here.** \n\nOnce I have that API key, I'll use it as a Bearer token in the MCP bridge — no OAuth needed, no browser login, no approval pages. Done in 2 minutes! 🎯"}
